		'Logic lives in src/host/subagents.ts (spawn, fork, running, finished, promote); tools/spawn.ts only checks input and tools/wait.ts only asks running(). SessionMeta gained parent, spawn (the kind) and slots; a session without slots has subagents.initialSlots() (5). tabs.label (moved from send.ts) names sessions for both tools.',
		"The child's first prompt is prompts.submit with Sender { from: parent }, so it runs as the child's own turn at once (child idle) and is framed '[Inbox · <parent label>]'. Interactive kinds get the bare task, still sent from the parent.",
		"wait ends the turn through ToolContext.endTurn: after the round's results the turn ends completed (reason tool_use), unless a steering message waits; then the model reads it next round instead. A handoff that arrives while the parent is idle starts its turn (task rj). running() = the parent's open child sessions of a subagent kind in a busy state (running, retrying, blocked).",
		"Fork copies the parent's history records (not its inbox records) and blobs, then answers the parent's in-flight round's tool calls with a 'this is a fork' result and ends that turn completed, so the copy is a valid, finished conversation before the child's prompt. mode defaults to fork as in the old tool, also for interactive; ask for fresh to get a blank one.",
